  "name": "Mythical Boon items vanish from the bags when the player leaves the dungeon",
  "contract": [
    "Mythical Boon items (2104920-2104935) only work inside a keystone run. Our tester asked for them to leave the bags",
    "as soon as the player leaves the dungeon. They stay while the player is inside, and go when the player changes to a map",
    "that is not a dungeon, or logs in outside one. A dead player who ends up outside, for example at a graveyard, keeps",
    "them for the run back; they go only if that player is brought back to life outside the dungeon."
  ],
